    "generalSituationZh": "受東北季候風及一道雲雨帶影響，明早廣東沿岸天氣清涼。隨著東北季候風緩和及雲帶轉薄，星期五該區天色好轉，日間氣溫回升。預料一股達強風程度的東北季候風會在週末期間影響華南沿岸，該區日間非常乾燥，日夜溫差頗大。一股偏東氣流會在下週初至中期影響廣東沿岸。",
    "generalSituationEn": "Under the influence of the northeast monsoon and a band of rain and clouds, it will be cool over the coast of Guangdong tomorrow morning. With the northeast monsoon moderating and the band of clouds thinning out, the weather will improve and daytime temperatures will rise over the region on Friday. A strong northeast monsoon is expected to affect the coast of southern China over the weekend. It will be very dry during the day over the region, and the temperature difference between day and night will be rather large. An easterly airstream will affect the coast of Guangdong early to midweek next week.",
